{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/03/16/3229021/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日花粉がひどくてもう大変です。\nくしゃみ1日に30回はしてます\nそのうち16回くらいはくしゃみが\n出なくて悔しい思いをしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"薬が効きませんくうううう.........(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐでアンダーライブが\n始まりますね！ドキドキです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんの卒業公演\nらりんさんとやる最後のライブと\n思うとライブやる楽しさの半面、\n終わりたくないなって\n思ってしまう自分がいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんちゅーするぞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/03/16/3229021/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13日にお茶会、似顔会、録音会がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶会は個人的に好きです\nあああ！？もう時間！？ってなるけど\n新鮮な感じがします♪\n温かいお茶を出せれば良かった(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"録音会は何だか今回は私から罵声？笑\nみたいな言葉をいわせるのが\n多かったかな？そんなに怒られたいのですね\nかしこまりました（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔会は\n自分で絵の上達が加速してる事を確信！\nですよね！だよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎質問返し◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・今1番やりたい事は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→旅行したいです‼︎\n行きたい所たくさんあるのに、\n全然行けていないので早く行きたいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛は人に合わせるタイプ？\n合わせないタイプ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→合わせるタイプです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛は次海外行くならどこがいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→またグアム行きたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠ってしまったあの無駄な時間を\n次はお買い物に使いたい！\nグアムでまったくお買い物出来なくて\n悔しい思いしたからリベンジ(o_o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・最近見たい映画ってあったりする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→最近映画の情報に追いついてなくて\nなにが上映されてるんだろう(o_o)\n教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・古着屋さんで服を選ぶ時に\n最も重視するのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→古着マニアという訳ではないので\n特にこだわりはありませんよ〜！\n直感でいいと思ったものを\n買っています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/03/16/3229021/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の逆質問はちょっと違った\n心理テストにしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白いご飯のお供にしたいおかずは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.たまごやき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.チョウチンアンコウ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.梅干し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多かった順に紹介していくと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位 梅干し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2位 たまごやき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3位 チョウチンアンコウ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心理テストの答えはですね〜\nじゃんじゃがじゃ〜ん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまごやきを選んだ人は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無難な道を歩む人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョウチンアンコウを選んだ人は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"派手好きな人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅干しを選んだ人は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"包み隠さない人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たっていますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の逆質問は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にとって大切なものは？\n(物、人物、動物...等)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です。コメントお待ちしております(^ ^)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/03/16/3229021/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅんとこの間美容院行ったの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またご飯でも久しぶりに行こうね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/03/16/3229021/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブまずは名古屋！\nもうすぐ！お待ちしております"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来る方は宜しくお願いします〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}